{
  "name": "The Shaft",
  "finish": {
    "x": -491,
    "y": 372
  },
  "description": "You start at the bottom of a mine shaft, and the only way out is up. Kick off the little ramp onto the first ledge, turn around (Space) and jump to the ledge on the other side, a little higher each time. Seven ledges take you to the rim, which juts out over the shaft. Ride left along the top and fly off the last kicker: the finish floats in the air above it.",
  "lesson": "Start at the bottom of a cave shaft and climb out by switchbacking between ledges on alternate sides, up to a finish that floats high above.",
  "alsoNew": "A start below ground, a floating finish.",
